        <mxCell id="HgBr_yeDXLSilMWp8V1L-87" value="&lt;b&gt;THE NETWORK MUST ENFORCE THAT ALL PACKETS MUST BE OF THE SAME SIZE AT ALL TIMES, WITH THE SAME TIMING BETWEEN PACKETS&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#a20025;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6F0000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
