        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-45" value="&lt;u&gt;The Nodes are not able to see beyond their own connections, as they don&#39;t decide where the packets go &lt;br&gt;(only clients do!)&lt;/u&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
