        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-145" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;8) Client A, has now banned Node F,J and O&lt;br&gt;for 30 minutes, it won&#39;t try to connect to them again.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(if the 3 nodes keep misbehaving after the ban expires,&lt;br&gt;the ban length will keep on doubling)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
