        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-163" value="Node D" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#a20025;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#6F0000;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="54.5" y="4172" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-164" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;Nodes A,C,G,H,I,L, and M&lt;br&gt;all have plenty of available bandwidth and&amp;nbsp;resources &lt;br&gt;to provide for the network, they adversize that they &lt;br&gt;should behave as intended&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-704.75" y="4162" width="296" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-165" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;Nodes F,J,K, and O&lt;br&gt;are under 75% load right now, &lt;br&gt;but still are able to take on more requests,&lt;br&gt;they advertize that they should behave as intended&lt;br&gt;but that they are almost overloaded&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-701.25" y="4312" width="289" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-166" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Nodes B,D,E,N and P are above 95% load right now, &lt;br&gt;They are refusing to take on more requests for the time being&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;because they wouldn&#39;t be able to process all of them&lt;br&gt;(and thus, they avoid bans)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;--&amp;gt; those could be the cheap VPSes that are easily overloaded&lt;br&gt;due to their 2 cpus and 100mbps bandwidth&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-732.25" y="4452" width="351" height="113" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-169" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;fillColor=#008a00;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" source="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-167" target="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-156" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="-102.25" y="4598" />
              <mxPoint x="-306.25" y="4598" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-167" value="Client A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-125.25" y="4643" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-168" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;Therefore, Client A selects a path that works &lt;br&gt;for his rendezvous point at node C,&lt;br&gt;priorizing the nodes that advertise themselves as&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;able to handle the load&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-247.75" y="4688" width="281" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v3IIzgveTb6yj0TpXEEh-173" value="&lt;u&gt;The Clients always send noise data around the network, to 3 decoy hidden service destinations&lt;/u&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
