        <mxCell id="iM8Zz2Tr5FXErz_H8n0_-1" value="client&#39; B&lt;br&gt;chosen 3x nodes ???" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1204" y="4827" width="79" height="79" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iM8Zz2Tr5FXErz_H8n0_-5" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;not sure how client A would even encrypt&lt;br&gt;the data of the remaining 3 nodes&lt;br&gt;since those are chosen by client B&lt;br&gt;(to be brainstormed?)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1126" y="4983" width="235" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iM8Zz2Tr5FXErz_H8n0_-6" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Everyone is a Node (those that are behind &lt;br&gt;NATs are only second-hops)&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430.19000000000005" y="2973" width="261.62" height="61" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iM8Zz2Tr5FXErz_H8n0_-24" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;Upon spinning up the daemon locally &lt;br&gt;(behind a NAT, from home, with no port forwarding), &lt;br&gt;you&#39;re automatically becoming&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;a node aswell,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;except that since people cant connect to your node directly,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;they have to go through another publicly accessible node to access yours&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="357" y="3050" width="408" height="98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="iM8Zz2Tr5FXErz_H8n0_-25" value="This means that:&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;- all entry nodes are publicly listed (IP:port)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;-all nodes that are behind NATs are only accessed &lt;br&gt;as second hops (via the entry nodes for whom &lt;br&gt;these nodes are connected to)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="413" y="3148" width="285" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
