        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hRJDUBrgxpCJInATjKRH-37" value="you can&#39;t just have a central DNS &lt;br&gt;that says &quot;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;Nowhere...nw is at IP 10.255.123.52&quot;,&lt;br&gt;We need to find a way to obscure the real IP address of a given hidden service, to prevent an adversary from figuring out where it&#39;s true location is from&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=1;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;movable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
