        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-83" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Node J can&#39;t know&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;if the packet&#39;s true destination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; box-shadow: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;is for E, I or M (only Node A knows)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1627" y="952.5" width="221" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-84" value="For a path length of 3 hops (D,G,J -&amp;gt; I), &lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;the adversary needs to control:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;-the 3 real hops in between, &lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;-AND the 2 destination decoys&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;(5 nodes for a path length of 3 hops)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;To be able to determine that Node A intended to talk to Node I&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(Decoy Nodes A,B, C,H, F , K are useless as decoys &lt;br&gt;if the adversary controlled E,M,J,G,D to begin with)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1397" y="954.5" width="396" height="127" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-85" value="&lt;u&gt;The end user chooses the decoy destinations, not the nodes themselves.&lt;br&gt;(unidirectionnal bi-circuits version)&lt;/u&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
