        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-240" value="2) B decrypts the packet and it says:&lt;br&gt;&quot;Hey B, forward this packet to E,C and D !&quot;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1983" y="-255.5" width="245" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-241" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;1) Obscuring the destination: (from the central node&#39;s POV)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;(the sender (node A) picks the decoy destinations that B should send to)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2260" y="-302.5" width="401" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-242" value="&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;2) Obscuring the source (from the central node&#39;s POV):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; box-shadow: none !important; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(27, 29, 30); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;(the sender asks 2 other decoys to forward the data to Node B)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2222.5028571428566" y="-38.99761904761908" width="246" height="51" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-248" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fillColor=#008a00;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" source="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-243" target="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-247" edge="1">
