        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-305" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;For a passive adversary, they see FAG and ECD talk to each other, &lt;br&gt;but they dont know which ones are the decoys&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;if an active adversary controls either F or G, then they know that A is the real source,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;but they don&#39;t know what&#39;s the real destination between ECD (since only A knows it)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;if an active adversary controls either E or D, then they know that C is the real destination,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;but they don&#39;t know what&#39;s the real source between AFG (since only C knows it)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;if an active adversary controls both either (F or G) AND (E or D), &lt;br&gt;then they know who&#39;s both the real sender and destination&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;if Node A is an active adversary, then they anyway know that Node C&#39;s the real destination&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#00ff00&quot;&gt;(but Node C doesn&#39;t know which is the real source, between AF or G, &lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;because it first started with A&#39;s request!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#00ff00&quot;&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;If Node C is the active adversary, then they don&#39;t know who&#39;s the real sender between A,F and G.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2904" y="-116.5" width="533" height="257" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Ks_VO9Inp2RuTejZyS4B-337" value="&lt;u&gt;Probabilistic path lengths in a bi-unidirectionnal circuits setting:&lt;/u&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-2893.43" y="2631.5" width="228" height="61" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
