        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-18" value="the current total path length for a given hidden service is 8&lt;br&gt;(6 nodes in between the client and the Hidden Service),&lt;br&gt;given the 2 circuits and their unidirectionnal nature,&lt;br&gt;it forms a circle which goes in one direction only." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5070" y="2735" width="326" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-19" value="Except that with probalistic path lengths &lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(which can vary between 1 hops and 3 hops at random,&lt;br&gt;in between either the source and the rendezvous point&lt;br&gt;or in between the destination and the rendezvouspoint&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;which means that the Client and Hidden service&lt;br&gt;can be at different places on the circle)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5075" y="2827" width="313" height="98" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-50" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#ff8000&quot;&gt;At the smallest possible size, the circle has 8 nodes,&lt;br&gt;6 nodes are in between Node A and the hidden service on Node E,&lt;br&gt;because both node A and E randomly picked a 1 hop circuit&lt;br&gt;to be able to reach each rendezvous point (node C and G)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4754" y="2622.5" width="372" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-51" value="Node A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
