        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-195" value="4) So depending on your node&#39;s hash, you will be randomly placed on that hashring, &lt;br&gt;and you&#39;re going to have neighboring nodes (whose hash will start with the same character as yours):" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
