        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-240" value="6) The default hidden service that all nodes have is there&lt;br&gt;to place them somewhere on the hashring, &lt;br&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;All hashring neighbor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;nodes keep&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ff0000&quot;&gt;track of one another&#39;s knowledge&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 128, 0);&quot;&gt;(that is to avoid requiring all nodes to &lt;br&gt;store the data relevant to all other nodes)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
