        <mxCell id="Yh95EMxYVOAF0Q5FzLhY-348" value="15.5) Node K was awaiting requests to serve as a RDV point&lt;br&gt;for clients requesting to contact the hidden service&lt;br&gt;whose hash is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;44AWDAWDSWA, &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;so he does just that and&lt;br&gt;routes the traffic where he was asked to do so.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
