        <mxCell id="R0iengJZwtPKdWFIPyWC-116" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Then the adversary can distinguish &lt;br&gt;(by&amp;nbsp;running a custom client on Node B, that&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;the real traffic was meant to be sent to Node A,&lt;br&gt;and that Node FGH are the decoy destinations)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
