        <mxCell id="QwyEQrVCva4sAPg_wC5w-14" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;5) A concludes that&lt;br&gt;Node C is not trustworthy&lt;br&gt;because it acts 2&lt;br&gt;different ways for&lt;br&gt;2 different nodes!&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
