        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-11" value="Node F" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#fa6800;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#C73500;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4774.25" y="-887.5" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-12" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fillColor=#008a00;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" source="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-13" target="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-15" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-13" value="RDV&lt;br&gt;Node G" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#6a00ff;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#3700CC;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4877.25" y="-847.5" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-14" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fillColor=#008a00;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" source="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-15" target="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-15" value="Node H" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#fa6800;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#C73500;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4981.25" y="-890.5" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-16" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.102;entryY=0.764;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fillColor=#008a00;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" source="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-1" target="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-5" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-17" value="1) Client A connects to RDV node C, via B&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;and verifies that node C has the certificate &lt;br&gt;(signed by the hidden service itself (by node E)&lt;br&gt;that proves that node C is allowed to&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;route traffic for the hidden service whose hash is 44AWDAW&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5370.25" y="-1050" width="338" height="84" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-18" value="0) Server Node E (with a hidden service) pays for RDV Node C to&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;route packets for it&#39;s hidden service whose hash is 44AWDAW,&lt;br&gt;and also pays for Node D to route packets coming from C back to E" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4581" y="-1087" width="377" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-19" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;2) Client A verifies the certificate with the hidden service&#39;s public key&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;and concludes that it is valid. Therefore Node A makes Node C route it&#39;s packets&lt;br&gt;in order to reach the hidden service destination&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5069" y="-1178" width="444" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-20" value="3) Hidden Service location Node E recieves client A&#39;s packets and&lt;br&gt;it includes the instructions of where to route the packets back to (to node RDV G)," style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4679" y="-966.5" width="452" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-21" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by E)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4897" y="-1072.5" width="92" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-22" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by E)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4826.25" y="-1021" width="92" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-23" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by E)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4817" y="-911" width="92" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-24" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by A)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4986" y="-1021" width="91" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-25" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by A)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4977" y="-911" width="91" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-26" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 255, 0);&quot;&gt;(chosen by A)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4899" y="-868.5" width="91" height="26" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-27" value="4) so Node E routes packets back to the Rendezvous node G, to ensure&lt;br&gt;the responses are sent back to Client Node A" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4850" y="-810" width="401" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-28" value="5) Client Node A recieves Server E&#39;s&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;responses as intended." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5216" y="-926" width="211" height="41" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-29" value="&lt;u&gt;END RESULT: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Node A is only aware that the circuit is contains nodes A, B, C, G and H.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;because Node A can&#39;t know the nodes beyond the rendezvous points, &lt;br&gt;(because those have been chosen by Node E)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And Node E is only aware that the circuit contains nodes C, D, E, F and G.&lt;br&gt;because Node E isn&#39;t able to know the nodes beyond the rendezvous points either&lt;br&gt;(because those have been chosen by Node A)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5052" y="-588.5" width="455" height="142" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-30" value="&lt;u&gt;Hidden Service&lt;br&gt;Routing protocol recap&lt;br&gt;(with certificates that rendezvous nodes&lt;br&gt;are allowed to route packets for clients)&lt;/u&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-4965" y="-1268" width="228" height="61" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tTgcX6jF4bR5ZKCmvHqc-31" value="&lt;div&gt;Client&lt;/div&gt;Node A" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-5265" y="-535.5" width="45" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
